cal collision for other characters while invisibility is enabled.\nModern GUI — Clean design with smooth animations, toggle effects, and notifications.\nMinimize & Restore — Minimize the GUI into a floating sphere and tap it to restore the main panel.\nDraggable Interface — Move the main GUI and minimized sphere wherever you want.\nClose Confirmation — Confirm before closing the GUI.\nRespawn Handling — Resets the invisibility state when your character respawns.\n\nWhat Does Alpha Mean?\n\nAlpha means this script is an early development version. It may still have bugs, incomplete features, or unexpected behavior. More improvements, fixes, and changes may come in future updates.\n\nHow to Use:\n\n1. Execute the script.\n2. Press the toggle in the GUI or press G to activate/deactivate invisibility.\n3. Stand up before enabling invisibility if your character is seated.\n4. Minimize the GUI whenever you want a smaller interface.\n\nNotice this script still Alpha A few Bugs may unexpectedly Appear.\n\n- Hypol-X Made","tags":["Invisible script","Invisible","Invisible gui"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"69b9a6ae942b0cf7aa0f6eef","username":"HypolX","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e71dbe3d579e4ae45c9fac2aea263db70610f2928bde16264510f38622e747b3.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69b9a6ae942b0cf7aa0f6eef-1792133650053.png"},"lvl":5,"status":"offline","id":"69b9a6ae942b0cf7aa0f6eef","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e71dbe3d579e4ae45c9fac2aea263db70610f2928bde16264510f38622e747b3.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69b9a6ae942b0cf7aa0f6eef-1792133650053.png"}},"reviewed":{"name":"QueueHero","role":"reviewer","roleLabel":"Paid reviewer","at":"2026-10-15T14:40:21.958Z","profile":"/u/QueueHero"},"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":fals